    "notes": "19 bars: eighth pickup (measure 0) and incomplete final bar of 5 eighths. 6/8 (bars 1-6, 8, 15-18), one hemiola bar in 3/4 (7) entered by a tie a'8~a'4 across the barline and the time change, 9/8 slip jig (9-12, mark B) with beam over a rest, dotted quarter rests (12), 12/8 slide (13-14, mark C) with a 2:3 duplet and a tied double stop <d' b'>4.~<d' b'>4. Grace cuts: slashed acciaccaturas (bars 1, 15) and one plain grace (bar 11). Fermata mid-piece (bar 16). In scan-severe.pdf the left crop removes most of the instrument name and the right crop cuts the staff ends / final barlines; the part is still \"Fiddle\".",
